{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_09597","headline":"送许拾遗恩归江宁拜亲 · 岑参","name":"送许拾遗恩归江宁拜亲","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"诏书下青琐，驷马还吴洲。\n束帛仍赐衣，恩波涨沧流。\n微禄将及亲，向家非远游。\n看君五斗米，不谢万户侯。\n适出西掖垣，如到南徐州。\n归心望海日，乡梦登江楼。\n大江盘金陵，诸山横石头。\n枫树隐茅屋，橘林系渔舟。\n种药疏故畦，钓鱼垂旧鈎。\n对月京口夕，观涛海门秋。\n天子怜谏官，论事不可休。\n早来丹墀下，高驾无淹留。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"岑参","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_09597.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_09597","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}